{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方表示，旺角警區特別職務隊聯同入境處根據線報及深入調查後，昨日（21日）在區內展開代號「冠軍」的跨部門反非法入境者及非法勞工行動，突擊巡查區內多個地點。</p><p>行動中，執法人員拘捕12名內地女子及2名外籍女子，年齡介乎18歲至37歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，稍後將交由入境處跟進。</p><p>據了解，全部涉案內地女子持雙程證到港，另外2名被捕外籍女子分別來自泰國和菲律賓，持護照入境。</p><figure><img alt=\"執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189730396490043392230541.jpeg/ikmrPt4Dudn4iM0u373ffKAsTSHh5S34XdlWgV3ZVoE\"/><figcaption>執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189730394141102080869701.jpeg/Dsd7QLObvx0BMJ-sBl68-zX4DoPtuSqaZhwhkmYcIZI\"/><figcaption>執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189730391796355072624593.jpeg/b18MIgiHE7WbmCF5NeYj7Tka9jNRonvpc5uZWHObmVg\"/><figcaption>執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189730389384499200456839.jpeg/4oq0LA-dyIvv4tt0aL8ONez_BWjAL3D4W0BUvFtAVLw\"/><figcaption>執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T16:40:40.423307+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:21:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:18:11.843509+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:37:41.784271+00:00","content_hash":"d1bbece4f3fba441095f16c62e46e77ebaeb65b91c5b30fc2f186c27ca294f0e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}